      <input type="checkbox" id="basis1"><label for="basis1" style="margin-left: 5px;">Denied Training</label>
      <input type="checkbox" id="basis2"><label for="basis2" style="margin-left: 5px;">Denied Employment</label>
      <input type="checkbox" id="basis3"><label for="basis3" style="margin-left: 5px;">Denied Contracting</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">What did the person you are complaining against do? (Check all that apply - provide documentation)</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="action1"><label for="action1" style="margin-left: 5px;">A. Failed to meet numerical goals, as set out in Section 3</label>
      <input type="checkbox" id="action2"><label for="action2" style="margin-left: 5px;">B. Failed to train and/or employ Section 3 businesses</label>
      <input type="checkbox" id="action3"><label for="action3" style="margin-left: 5px;">C. Failed to ensure that contractors and subcontractors comply with Section 3</label>
      <input type="checkbox" id="action4"><label for="action4" style="margin-left: 5px;">D. Failed to notify Section 3 businesses about training and/or employment opportunities</label>
      <input type="checkbox" id="action5"><label for="action5" style="margin-left: 5px;">E. Failed to notify Section 3 businesses about contracting opportunities</label>
      <input type="checkbox" id="action6"><label for="action6" style="margin-left: 5px;">F. Failed to provide preferences for Section 3 businesses in contracting opportunities</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">When did the address checked above occur? (Include the most recent date if several dates are involved):</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 30%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 20px;">
      <span data-field="date_of_occurrence">{{ date_of_occurrence }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
